{"info": {"address1": "Office No.3", "address2": "Level 2 Centrium, Phoenix Market City 15, Lal Bahadur Shastri Marg, Kurla (West)", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400070", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 6980 1700", "website": "https://hindustanfoodslimited.com", "industry": "Conglomerates", "industryKey": "conglomerates", "industryDisp": "Conglomerates", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Hindustan Foods Limited engages in the business of contract manufacturing of fast moving consumer goods in India and internationally. The company offers breakfast cereals, instant porridges, rice crispies, soups and soup powders, spices and masala, sauces, dips, pastes, jams, jellies, preserves, gravies, cookies, protein and granola bars, chikkis, and muesli; and hot and cold beverages, and energy drink concentrates comprising carbonated soft drinks, ice cream, dessert, tea, coffee, malt-based food, glucose powder, and dry mix powder. It also provides hair oil, food, gel, cream, and shampoo; talc, shaving cream, hand wash liquid and powder, Eau De Toilette, and after shave lotion; baby care products; body lotion, moisturizer, creams, petroleum jelly, shower gel, face wash and scrub, body scrub and wipes, and dusting powder; and beauty and make-up products, including lipstick, lip colour, lip crayon, lip paint, chap stick, pressed/compact powders, and eye make-up products. In addition, the company offers leather and sports footwear and accessories that consists of men's, women's, and juniors' footwear, as well as slippers and flip-flops, and uppers; fabric care products, including liquid and powder detergent, and fabric conditioners; home care products, such as surface, glass, and toilet cleaners, as well as liquid dish wash; pet food and hygiene products; and liquid vaporizers, aerosols, coils, mosquito mats, and activ cards. Further, it provides vitamins, minerals, and nutraceuticals; nutrition products comprising super, plant-based, and organic foods; allopathic, herbal, and ayurvedic cosmeceutical and skin care products; foot care products, such as medicated and non-medicated plaster; medicated lozenges; digestive remedies; gels and ointments; oral liquids; allopathic tablets; diabetic and high protein nutrition products; and dusting and cosmetic powder. The company was incorporated in 1984 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 1458, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sameer Ramanlal Kothari", "age": 51, "title": "MD & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1974, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 42460000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Mayank  Samdani", "age": 46, "title": "Group Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Bankim Dilip Purohit", "age": 44, "title": "Company Secretary, Legal Head & Compliance Officer", "yearBorn": 1981, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ganesh Tukaram Argekar", "age": 53, "title": "Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1972, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 12538845, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vimal  Solanki", "title": "GM of International Business Development & Corporate Communications", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Alok  Bodhankar", "title": "General Manager of Human Resources", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjay  Sehgal", "title": "President of Healthcare & Wellness", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sunil  Plakkat", "title": "President of Manufacturing Excellence", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Manojkumar  Patani", "title": "President 